{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["And he encountered the place — his journey happened to bring him to a certain place outside the city of Luz." "For the sun had set — and he had no time to enter the city by day. As Rav Yehuda said: a person should always enter 'for good' and depart 'for good'." "And he took — one." "Of the stones of the place — as it is written: ״ויקח את האבן אשר שם מראשותיו״."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 28, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:45:32.637843727Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}